{"3509840": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Voxlife Greek", "steam_appid": 3509840, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a vast MMORPG set in <strong>ancient Greek mythology</strong>, where <strong>crafting, rare item hunting, boss battles, and PvP warfare</strong> shape your journey. Start with no skills and unlock them through quests. Explore a world ruled by gods and monsters, earn divine blessings from legendary Gods, forge alliances and crush your enemies to dominate the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509840/extras/8fb26a92f86a66855d816c41c15e3c46.poster.avif?t=1766450767\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509840/extras/8fb26a92f86a66855d816c41c15e3c46.webm?t=1766450767\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509840/extras/8fb26a92f86a66855d816c41c15e3c46.mp4?t=1766450767\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Forge Your Legend</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock Skills Through Adventure</strong> – Begin with nothing and earn every skill through quests given by NPCs. Slay monsters, gather resources, and complete challenges to shape your character’s destiny.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Claim Divine Blessings</strong> – Defeat powerful bosses and receive unique blessings that enhance your abilities, from gathering boosts to combat enhancements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509840/extras/26c56ab05c563dd99f69ace466742e9c.poster.avif?t=1766450767\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509840/extras/26c56ab05c563dd99f69ace466742e9c.webm?t=1766450767\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509840/extras/26c56ab05c563dd99f69ace466742e9c.mp4?t=1766450767\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A World Ruled by War and Strategy</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PvP Without Limits</strong> – In this open-world MMORPG, anyone can be your enemy. Form alliances, wage wars, and conquer territories to rise in power.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rich PvE Experience</strong> – Face diverse creatures, each with unique mechanics and behaviors. From roaming beasts to towering gods, every fight is a test of skill and strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thrive in a Social Realm</strong> – Strength comes in numbers. Team up to take down powerful foes, trade rare items, and build lasting empires.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509840/extras/aaf0dee7286105ed8b4bf9580bb22cca.poster.avif?t=1766450767\" width=698 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509840/extras/aaf0dee7286105ed8b4bf9580bb22cca.webm?t=1766450767\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509840/extras/aaf0dee7286105ed8b4bf9580bb22cca.mp4?t=1766450767\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Will You Rise as a Hero or Fall as a Forgotten Soul?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only the strongest will carve their names into myth. Will you fight, conquer, and ascend or be lost to history?</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a vast MMORPG set in <strong>ancient Greek mythology</strong>, where <strong>crafting, rare item hunting, boss battles, and PvP warfare</strong> shape your journey. Start with no skills and unlock them through quests. Explore a world ruled by gods and monsters, earn divine blessings from legendary Gods, forge alliances and crush your enemies to dominate the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509840/extras/8fb26a92f86a66855d816c41c15e3c46.poster.avif?t=1766450767\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509840/extras/8fb26a92f86a66855d816c41c15e3c46.webm?t=1766450767\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509840/extras/8fb26a92f86a66855d816c41c15e3c46.mp4?t=1766450767\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Forge Your Legend</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock Skills Through Adventure</strong> – Begin with nothing and earn every skill through quests given by NPCs. Slay monsters, gather resources, and complete challenges to shape your character’s destiny.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Claim Divine Blessings</strong> – Defeat powerful bosses and receive unique blessings that enhance your abilities, from gathering boosts to combat enhancements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509840/extras/26c56ab05c563dd99f69ace466742e9c.po